@title Cabinet: Place all lays the row ducts against the trunk's side, no duct over another
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The cabinet lesson plate with nothing placed. Place all adds the vertical trunk duct and the row ducts; the
# row ducts end against the trunk's side (a T junction), so the problems pill shows no duct crossing.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-unplaced-plate.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 40
shot preview
expect "Preview"
click_text "Accept"
wait 40
shot after
expect "0 problems"
expect "No issues"
check_layout
